flowchart LR
    subgraph Clients["Capture and context"]
        Web["React web app<br/>phone camera + review UI"]
        Device["ESP32-S3 firmware<br/>or Python camera"]
        Retailer["Verified Nemlig<br/>order and invoice email"]
    end

    subgraph Ingress["Authenticated ingress"]
        Hosting["Firebase Hosting"]
        Auth["Firebase Authentication"]
        API["Cloud Run API"]
        Mail["App Engine<br/>mail gateway"]
    end

    subgraph Async["Durable asynchronous workflow"]
        Events["Pub/Sub topics<br/>retries + dead letters"]
        Workers["Cloud Run workers<br/>group · infer · mail · export · notify"]
    end

    subgraph Agent["Agentic inference"]
        ADK["Google ADK agent<br/>bounded account tools"]
        Gemini["Gemini 3.6 Flash<br/>Vertex AI EU"]
    end

    subgraph Data["Private tenant-scoped data"]
        Firestore[("Cloud Firestore<br/>events · meals · knowledge · purchases")]
        Storage[("Cloud Storage<br/>images · mail · traces · exports")]
    end

    Ops["Cloud Logging + Monitoring<br/>alerts · spend ceilings · audit"]

    Web --> Hosting --> API
    Web --> Auth --> API
    Device -->|revocable camera credential| API
    Retailer --> Mail --> Events
    API -->|capture and work events| Events
    Events --> Workers
    Workers -->|group and persist| Firestore
    Workers -->|private evidence| Storage
    Workers -->|run inference| ADK
    ADK -->|structured multimodal request| Gemini
    ADK -->|bounded context retrieval| Firestore
    API <-->|owner-scoped reads and writes| Firestore
    API <-->|private media streaming| Storage
    API --> Web

    API -.-> Ops
    Mail -.-> Ops
    Workers -.-> Ops

    classDef primary fill:#1f3b2f,color:#fffdf7,stroke:#1f3b2f,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef accent fill:#f4b942,color:#17231d,stroke:#d99c25,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef data fill:#f7f3e9,color:#17231d,stroke:#6d7f74,stroke-width:2px;
    class API,ADK primary;
    class Gemini accent;
    class Firestore,Storage data;
